{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Who Are You!?",
    "steam_appid": 2646450,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/450c3a44728c2b73bbf27c6f60c7ec9d.avif?t=1749858625\" width=600 height=64 /></span><strong>This is a demo with an estimated playtime of 40 minutes, where you will explore an introductory level and &quot;The Cabin&quot; level. This is a deep, engaging experience with an immersive narrative, so pay attention to your surroundings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f No AI was used for art, sound design or development in this game. Every aspect crafted by human hands and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/b090f1a6a1fb5cc5e2e0e538865bcfb0.avif?t=1749858625\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Are You!? is a sci-fi psychological horror game, where you'll face the unknown in order to save your family.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/98e18ed76a5ead512bb1ab35d69caef0.webp?t=1749858625\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/be04c112f0a7c390223b49ab9c7037c0.avif?t=1749858625\" width=600 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research Collaboration Notice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who Are You!? is developed with the support and insights of renowned Argentine ufologists Silvia and Andrea P\u00e9rez Simondini.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silvia is a pioneering UFO researcher, founder of the UFO Museum in Victoria, Entre R\u00edos, and director of the research group Visi\u00f3n OVNI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Andrea is Director of CEFORA and South America Continental Director for ICER, recognized internationally for her work on UAPs and anomalous phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their real-world investigations and knowledge have helped shape the game's narrative and authenticity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/a3db0cda9a2731905c5d44fc225a616b.webp?t=1749858625\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep narrative based on true ufology stories and investigations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional and psychological interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/9931786de648ebf6d1afa0cf57dbfbcc.webp?t=1749858625\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The story follows Ray Roswell, who lost his wife 20 years ago. Now, his only daughter has gone missing. In his search for her, Ray not only embarks on a physical journey but also confronts the emotional and psychological trauma of his past, reliving the pain he has tried to forget.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/450c3a44728c2b73bbf27c6f60c7ec9d.avif?t=1749858625\" width=600 height=64 /></span><strong>This is a demo with an estimated playtime of 40 minutes, where you will explore an introductory level and &quot;The Cabin&quot; level. This is a deep, engaging experience with an immersive narrative, so pay attention to your surroundings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f No AI was used for art, sound design or development in this game. Every aspect crafted by human hands and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/b090f1a6a1fb5cc5e2e0e538865bcfb0.avif?t=1749858625\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Are You!? is a sci-fi psychological horror game, where you'll face the unknown in order to save your family.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/98e18ed76a5ead512bb1ab35d69caef0.webp?t=1749858625\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/be04c112f0a7c390223b49ab9c7037c0.avif?t=1749858625\" width=600 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research Collaboration Notice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who Are You!? is developed with the support and insights of renowned Argentine ufologists Silvia and Andrea P\u00e9rez Simondini.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silvia is a pioneering UFO researcher, founder of the UFO Museum in Victoria, Entre R\u00edos, and director of the research group Visi\u00f3n OVNI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Andrea is Director of CEFORA and South America Continental Director for ICER, recognized internationally for her work on UAPs and anomalous phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their real-world investigations and knowledge have helped shape the game's narrative and authenticity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/a3db0cda9a2731905c5d44fc225a616b.webp?t=1749858625\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep narrative based on true ufology stories and investigations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional and psychological interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/9931786de648ebf6d1afa0cf57dbfbcc.webp?t=1749858625\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The story follows Ray Roswell, who lost his wife 20 years ago. Now, his only daughter has gone missing. In his search for her, Ray not only embarks on a physical journey but also confronts the emotional and psychological trauma of his past, reliving the pain he has tried to forget.</p>",
    "short_description": "Get immersed into a deep sci-fi psychological horror experience, where you'll have to fight through your memories and emotions while reality blurs when you try to understand the disappearance of your wife 20 years ago, and the current whereabouts of your daughter.",
